# Binary asset types — store as raw git blobs, no LFS, no text diff/merge.
# These were on Git LFS upstream (vendor RevivrStudios/Polyarc sample);
# de-LFSed for this ibrews fork to avoid LFS budget on free GitHub plan.
*.uasset    binary
*.uexp      binary
*.umap      binary
*.ubulk     binary
*.png       binary
*.exr       binary
*.wav       binary
*.mp3       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.metallib  binary
*.metalmap  binary
